abstract: "An agent-based simulation of a game of basketball. The model implements\
  \ most components of a standard game of basketball. Additionally, the model allows\
  \ the user to test for the effect of two separate cognitive biases \u2013 the hot-hand\
  \ effect and a belief in the team's franchise player.\n"
